repository-code: "https://github.com/pradeepdegalaroyal/herald-aware-dynamical-decoupling-spin-memory"
abstract: "Simulation study of how a spin memory in a quantum network should be dynamically decoupled when the release time (herald arrival) is random, comparing tuned CPMG, learned schedules and a herald-triggered closing pulse against a known-time optimum."
keywords:
  - dynamical decoupling
  - spin qubits
  - quantum networks
  - quantum memory
